  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "Vite dev server (:5173) proxies /api to uvicorn :8000; every hook appends ?workspace= (hotpot | nimbu) from WorkspaceContext.",
        "Demo auth middleware gates every route except /api/auth/* when DEMO_AUTH_ENABLED=1; login sets an HMAC-signed cookie.",
        "VITE_USE_MOCKS=true routes the SPA to in-browser mock handlers; BLACKBOX_MOCK_API=1 makes the API serve JSON fixtures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Jobs & persistence",
      "items": [
        "Replay, repair, live runs, simulate and verify-fix run in a 4-thread executor; the UI polls GET /jobs/{id} every 700 ms.",
        "All routers open SQLModel sessions on one engine: Neon Postgres when DATABASE_URL is set, else SQLite WAL at data/blackbox.db.",
        "The job that finishes a live/simulated run calls on_run_finished(run) for the incident engine; the API also reads runs, incidents and eval.json directly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Counterfactual engine",
      "items": [
        "Tracer.step reuses the source step's output when the input hash matches and idx < freeze_before_idx; otherwise it executes via the cassette.",
        "Bisect halves the freeze index until the first failing step, then verifies by regenerating that step; verified labels get confidence 1.0.",
